                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_All_ProductItems_on_Current_PO</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Yes, current PO exists</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>05/28/26 (GD) – Replaces DLRS rule NumberOfCheckedInItemsPO update path. Fires when Purchasing_Opportunity__c changes on ProductItem. Synchronous path recalculates the prior Opportunity count using $Record__Prior; async path recalculates the current Opportunity count.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>ProductItem | Asynchronous, on update, Number of Checked In Items PO Roll Up {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>ProductItem | Asynchronous, on update, Number of Checked In Items PO Roll Up</label>
